      "text": "**Vulnerability:** The Next.js application was missing essential global security headers, specifically `X-Content-Type-Options`, `X-Frame-Options`, `X-XSS-Protection`, `Strict-Transport-Security`, and `Referrer-Policy`. This exposed the app"
